<title>RUSSIA: Russian April inflation 15.3 pct yr/yr vs 16.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian April inflation 15.3 pct yr/yr vs 16.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's consumer price inflation slowed in April to 15.3 percent year-on-year, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    APR 97    MAR 97    APR 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +1.0	+1.4	+2.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +15.3     +16.7     +68.3</p>
<p>Prices in April were 6.4 percent higher than in December last year.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
